{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-detail-template-js","path":"/blog/provident-sustainability-initiative-gains-global-media-spotlight/","result":{"data":{"strapiBlog":{"createdAt":"2025-04-28T05:53:13.030Z","updatedAt":"2025-05-01T10:04:22.661Z","video_url":null,"title":"It's Trending! Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s Sustainability Initiative Makes Headlines Everywhere","short_description":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s unwavering commitment to sustainability has recently earned widespread recognition as its latest campaign, A Home for You, A Tree for the Planet, has garnered extensive media coverage.","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.jpg"},"team_contact":null,"strapi_id":456,"slug":"provident-sustainability-initiative-gains-global-media-spotlight","publish":true,"id":"67d08903-7cd0-55b9-9bef-859b225e40a0","rank":null,"date":"April 28, 2025","category":{"strapi_json_value":["Dubai Market Trends & News"],"id":"a49c9e62-c219-570b-b75e-930de3fd9e12"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.jpg"},"author":null,"modules":[{"id":"0b61f0ef-b17f-555a-a98b-ab7d983826fa","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":933,"text":{"data":{"text":"<p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s unwavering commitment to sustainability has recently earned widespread recognition as its latest campaign, A Home for You, A Tree for the Planet, has garnered extensive media coverage. Esteemed media outlets have highlighted the initiative, applauding its relevance to Dubai’s green vision and recognition of sustainable development. Find out what media outlets and publications around the globe are saying about Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s Sustainability Initiative.</p><h2>Media Applauds Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s Tree Planting Initiative</h2><p>Lovin Dubai, our valued media partner, shared the story behind this meaningful initiative, highlighting its positive environmental impact across the UAE. Their coverage celebrated our commitment to planting trees for every home sold, reinforcing the message that real estate can drive real change.</p><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background:#FFF;border-radius:3px;border:0;box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);margin:1px;max-width:540px;min-width:326px;padding:0;width:calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://instagram.com/p/DIvZEmtJASz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:row;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:50%;flex-grow:0;height:40px;margin-right:14px;width:40px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-grow:1;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;margin-bottom:6px;width:100px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;width:60px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:19% 0;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:block;height:50px;margin:0 auto 12px;width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.34