"background-color:#F4F4F4;flex-grow:0;height:12px;transform:translateY(-4px);width:16px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"border-left:8px solid transparent;border-top:8px solid #F4F4F4;height:0;transform:translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);width:0;\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-grow:1;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;margin-bottom:6px;width:224px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;width:144px;\">&nbsp;</div></div><p style=\"color:#c9c8cd;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17px;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden;padding:8px 0 7px;text-align:center;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;\"><a style=\"color:#c9c8cd;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:17px;text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://instagram.com/p/DIvZEmtJASz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\">A post shared by Lovin Dubai | لوڤن دبي (@lovindubai)</a></p></div></blockquote><script async=\"\" src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script><p>&nbsp;MENAFN, a leading source for financial news in the Middle East and North Africa, spotlighted our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/blog/provident-sustainability-initiative/\">A Home for You, A Tree for the Planet initiative</a>, emphasizing its alignment with the UAE’s Net Zero 2050 strategy and the Dubai 2040 Urban Master Plan—a testament to our ongoing commitment to local sustainability and environmental stewardship.&nbsp;</p><p>Building on this recognition, Benzinga highlighted our impactful collaboration with Evertreen, showcasing how every property sold through Zoya Ventures Real Estate contributes to a lasting environmental legacy. Each client receives a personalized digital certificate and satellite-tracked updates, directly connecting their investment to the growth of a greener UAE.&nbsp;</p><p>Echoing this sentiment, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://theamericawatch.com/article/805522870-provident-real-estate-launches-a-home-for-you-a-tree-for-the-planet-initiative-in-support-of-dubai-s-green-vision\">America</a> Watch noted that the initiative not only strengthens our dedication to responsible business practices but also reflects a growing awareness among today’s homebuyers of the value of sustainable living and eco-conscious choices.&nbsp;</p><p>Meanwhile, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://fox21news.com/business/press-releases/ein-presswire/805522870/provident-real-estate-launches-a-home-for-you-a-tree-for-the-planet-initiative-in-support-of-dubais-green-vision/\">FOX21</a>, another renowned voice in the media landscape, described the campaign as “a powerful step toward supporting the UAE’s sustainability ambitions,” reinforcing the far-reaching impact of our efforts to align real estate with meaningful environmental progress.&nbsp;</p><p>Here are some other publications that covered Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s “A Home for You, A Tree for the Planet” Sustainability Initiative:</p><ul><li>Abu Dhabi Reporter</li><li>UAE Daily Journal</li><li>Emirates Free Press</li><li>UAE Tech News Tracker</li><li>Green Earth News UAE</li><li>Home Buyer News Online</li><li>The Green Earth Gazette</li><li>Environmental Post Ledger</li><li>Environmental News Watch</li><li>Earth Matters Journal</li><li>My Real Estate Gazette</li><li>International Real Estate Times</li><li>Real Estate Press Releases</li><li>Healthy Planet Today</li><li>Global Real Estate Watch</li><li>Sustainable Earth Reporter</li></ul>"}}},{"id":"9d3f5932-4e6e-5a49-8fa1-8069fc9e6fc5","strapi_id":472,"strapi_component":"modules.ads-banner","small":false,"marketing_banner":{"title":"UAE Real Estate Market Sentiment Report 2026