"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/DAMAC_ISLAND_2_1863f43fdf.webp","transform":"1128x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/DAMAC_ISLAND_2_1863f43fdf.webp","transform":"492x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/DAMAC_ISLAND_2_1863f43fdf.jpg","transform":"1128x","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/DAMAC_ISLAND_2_1863f43fdf.jpg","transform":"492x","format":"jpg"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/Inaura_Hotels_and_Residences_2_9ea6bc3086.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/Inaura_Hotels_and_Residences_2_9ea6bc3086.webp","transform":"492x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/Inaura_Hotels_and_Residences_2_9ea6bc3086.webp","transform":"1128x","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/Dubai_View_c6518bd934.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/Dubai_View_c6518bd934.webp","transform":"1128x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/Dubai_View_c6518bd934.webp","transform":"492x","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/sentiment_survey_c146cbad3b.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/sentiment_survey_c146cbad3b.webp","transform":"492x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/sentiment_survey_c146cbad3b.webp","transform":"1128x","format":"webp"}]}],"heading":"5 Audience Groups | Across 90+ Countries","publish":true,"rank":4,"strapi_id":14,"style":null}},{"id":"f6ff5131-9ca4-5f75-b5e9-d60ab077f6a0","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":934,"text":{"data":{"text":"<h2>About the Initiative</h2><p>For every property purchased through Zoya Ventures Real Estate, a tree is planted locally in the UAE, reinforcing our belief that real estate can be a force for environmental good. In partnership with global reforestation platform Evertreen, buyers receive a personalized digital certificate and satellite-tracked updates of their tree, offering a tangible way to connect with their impact and leave a lasting ecological footprint.</p><p>This initiative directly supports the Dubai 2040 Urban Master Plan and the UAE Net Zero 2050 strategy, by enhancing green spaces, combating desertification, and encouraging sustainable urban growth. Whether you're a first-time homebuyer or a seasoned investor, your decision to purchase with Zoya Ventures Real Estate contributes to a larger movement—one that prioritizes environmental responsibility, local biodiversity, and a healthier, cooler climate for generations to come.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/About_the_Initiative_550779f550.jpg\" alt=\"About the Initiative\"></p><p>Want to play your role in building a greener tomorrow? Starting <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/\">Investing in Dubai Real Estate</a> Now!</p>"}}},{"id":"66e47f3d-a4db-571e-8bc9-b332b796d3ad","title":"FAQs","strapi_id":347,"strapi_component":"modules.faq","cta_text":null,"bg_color":"white","faqs":[{"strapi_id":6575,"question":"What is Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s Sustainability Initiative 2025?","id":"93c7b9cb-8295-5edf-8f5a-33209207353f","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s sustainability initiative 2025 is a strategic environmental commitment focused on contributing to Dubai’s sustainable future, with campaigns like A Home for You, A Tree for the Planet.<br>&nbsp;</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":6576,"question":"Which media platforms featured Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s sustainability initiative 2025?","id":"fa35c16b-60d8-5651-91ed-2794d4ebd392","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>The initiative was featured by various reputable platforms, including Benzinga, MENAFN, FOX21 News, and Lovin Dubai, underlining its strong relevance and impact.<br>&nbsp;</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":6577,"question":"Why is Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s sustainability initiative 2025 significant in Dubai’s real estate market?","id":"6ae8e7be-93be-5fdf-9c1c-3940edcea0fe","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>It merges investment with environmental responsibility, addressing global concerns while supporting Dubai’s sustainability targets.</p>"}}}]}],"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.webp","transform":"340x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1260x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.webp","transform":"1260x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/339x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.webp","transform":"339x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/696x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.webp","transform":"696x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1000x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.webp","transform":"1000x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/It_s_Trending_Provident_s_Sustainability_Initiative_Makes_Headlines_Everywhere_013cfc6cb7.jpg","transform":"340x","format":"jpg"}]}],"seo":{"id":"bcc0c94f-0dd9-5706-9d8e-630485fc328b","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s sustainability initiative 2025 receives top media coverage as it drives eco-conscious action in Dubai's real estate sector.","metaTitle":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s Sustainability Initiative Gains Global Media Spotlight","strapi_id":1779}}},"pageContext":{"id":"67d08903-7cd0-55b9-9bef-859b225e40a0"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1722115342","1797776728","2073252141","3432741055","3472835299","3592264445","3783427077","4119191191","702895677","867548045"]}